# Local-first guard for the graphify code graph.
#
# `graphify extract --code-only` keeps everything on-machine, but the auto-rebuild
# hooks call `graphify update`, which has no --code-only flag. Without this file the
# rebuild would send PDFs, images and video to a model whenever an API key happens to
# be present in the environment — and this stack has one configured for LiteLLM.
#
# Markdown is safe to index: graphify extracts headings and links structurally
# (_origin: ast), with no model call. These formats have no such path.
*.pdf
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.webp
*.gif
*.mp4
*.mov
*.mp3
*.wav

# Generated / vendored trees that add nodes without adding meaning.
graphify-out/
.ast-cache/
